Actually it was not a lib change, this is a list of RPM images that need to
be installed to run a 2.2.* kernel on RH5.2:

util-linux-2.9-0.alpha.rpm
modutils-2.1.121-0.alpha.rpm
net-tools-1.50-0.alpha.rpm
dhcpcd-1.3.16-0.alpha.rpm
ipchains-1.3.8-0.alpha.rpm
mount-2.9-0.alpha.rpm
psacct-6.3-10.alpha.rpm
initscripts-3.78-2.4.alpha.rpm
initscripts-3.78-2.3.alpha.rpm
procinfo-15-0.alpha.rpm

You can get them at:
ftp://ftp.freesoftware.com/pub/linux/redhat/updates/5.2/kernel-2.2/alpha

or most RedHat update mirrors..

JJ

